grabbyhands (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New: Smart Edit (optional, off by default). Describe an edit in plain
    words and Claude makes it with the editor's own tools, using your own
    Anthropic API key, with cost estimates and spending limits.
  * GrabbyHands goes online only for Smart Edit, after it is turned on.
  * Suggests python3-anthropic and gir1.2-secret-1 for Smart Edit.

